---
Copy files between the host and a sandbox

Usage: sbt cp [OPTIONS] <SRC> <DST>

Arguments:
  <SRC>


  <DST>


Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -L, --follow-link
          Follow symbolic links in the host source

  -h, --help
          Print help
